# Chips accepted with a CCB Polymer already held (a GM item): the chips at Cid show ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (nil).
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrade
char zone=Metalworks pos=-12.6,-11,4
quest Bastok.Chips accepted
item CcbPolymer
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
login
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # the polymer held: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (nil)
